The detach is done by the normal truncate path:

```text
delete_from_page_cache_batch()
truncate_inode_pages_range()
truncate_pagecache()
xfs_vn_setattr_size()
xfs_vn_setattr()
notify_change()
do_truncate()
path_openat()
do_file_open()
__x64_sys_open()
```

